  "bodyHash": "9ce6a236b30c7a73",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">永恆地獄（Eternal Nether）將 Minecraft 最炎熱的維度升溫至極限，把這片熾熱的冥界轉化為全新的戰場！探索宛如堡壘的豬布林莊園、聳立雲端的堡壘要塞以及充滿幽靈的地下墓穴，每個地方都盤踞著兇猛的新怪物，並隱藏著從灰燼中尋得的強大寶藏。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">拯救盟友、擊敗腐化敵人，在這片比以往更活躍、也更致命的地獄中刻寫你的命運。全新怪物、全新戰利品、全新方塊——當然，還有多得過量的熔岩。帶上你最強的裝備、最敏銳的反應，或許再多準備幾瓶防火藥水……你一定會用上的！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏰 全新建築結構</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏠 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">豬布林莊園（Piglin Manor）</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：隱藏在绯紅森林深處，這座雄偉莊園是身經百戰的豬布林與兇猛豬布林獵人的棲息地。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">堡壘要塞（The Citadel）</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：聳立在扭曲森林之上，這座古代前哨站庇護著危險且已腐化的扭曲終界使者。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">☠️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">地下墓穴（The Catacombs）</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一座巨型的凋靈形狀遺蹟，爬滿了致命的凋靈骷髏變體，等待被發掘的秘密層出不窮。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚔️ 全新生物</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">豬布林獵人（Piglin Hunters）</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：手持盾牌，並掛著狩獵戰利品。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔔 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">豬布林囚犯（Piglin Prisoners）</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：可用金幣與傳說中的下界合金鈴鐺解救——並將回報英雄們一面 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">無法損壞的下界合金盾</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">扭曲終界使者（Warped Endermen）</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：見人便攻擊——使用剪刀逐步淨化它們吧！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪓 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">腐屍者（Corpors）</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、🗡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋靈骷髏騎士</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、🌫️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">魅影殺手（Wraithers）</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">以及 👻 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Wex</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">為地獄的黑暗甬道帶來了全新的挑戰。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛠️ 全新裝備與物品</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔔 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">下界合金鈴鐺（Netherite Bell）</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：解放被囚禁豬布林所需的關鍵道具。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">軍刀（Cutlass）</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：一款迅捷的全新武器，搭載經典持劍格擋機制。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛡️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">下界合金盾（Netherite Shield）</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：堅固不壞，且不會因重擊而失效。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💿 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋靈圓舞曲音樂唱片（Wither Waltz Music Disc）</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：為你的地獄基地增添詭譎的新音效。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">扭曲終界之眼（Warped Ender Pearl）</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：傳送時附帶防火、緩降等增益效果！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧱 全新建築方塊</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🪨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋蝕黑石（Withered Blackstone）</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：完整的方塊系列，包含裂解版與裝飾變體。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">☠️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋蝕骨塊</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、🪵 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋蝕煤塊</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、🌋 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋蝕玄武岩</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">以及 🥶 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋蝕石英</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 方塊系列。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">扭曲地獄磚（Warped Nether Brick）</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：為地獄經典帶來嶄新演繹！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌾 農業強化</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🦴 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋蝕骨粉（Withered Bone Meal）</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：為你的作物注入超強動力——效果遠勝普通骨粉！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">客戶端與伺服器皆需安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（適用於 Fabric 與 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（適用於 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">（適用於 Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若模組支援，可直接透過遊戲內的模組選單進行設定（Fabric 平台需安裝由 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 開發的 </span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）。請注意，在較舊的 Minecraft 版本中，也必須安裝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若要使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有檔案皆位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，檔名分別為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，視配置類型而定。並非所有類型的設定檔都會存在，甚至可能完全沒有。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">特別感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/izofar\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Izofar</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 最初打造了令人驚嘆的 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bygone-nether\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Bygone Nether</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 模組。本模組忠實延續了其作品，並加入了部分新功能、改進、全面翻新與錯誤修復。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tamlighter\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Tamlighter</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 創作了許多精彩的新型貼圖。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/metal-bundles\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/metalbundles/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/leaves-be-gone\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/leavesbegone/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/enchanting-infuser\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/eternalnether/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
